---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-20">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">SW-IT Contest 2026</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-ink/70">
      충남대학교 컴퓨터인공지능학부 알고리즘 동아리 ANA
    </p>

    {/* 토큰 확인용 스캐폴드. 실제 섹션 구현 시 교체한다. */}
    <ul class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3" aria-label="디자인 토큰">
      <li class="rounded bg-orange px-3 py-2 text-paper">orange</li>
      <li class="rounded bg-orange-title px-3 py-2 text-paper">orange-title</li>
      <li class="rounded bg-orange-soft px-3 py-2 text-ink">orange-soft</li>
      <li class="rounded bg-gold px-3 py-2 text-ink">gold</li>
      <li class="rounded border border-ink bg-paper px-3 py-2 text-ink">paper</li>
      <li class="rounded bg-ink px-3 py-2 text-paper">ink</li>
    </ul>
  </main>
</Layout>
